# The Night Lord's third job node: a scroll left hanging in the air that fires
# stars for twelve seconds and bursts as it goes.
#
# GMS's own figures: 700+27x% a star, six of them at each of up to seven
# enemies and seven more whatever the crowd is, then 1570+62x% twelve times on
# twelve enemies when the duration ends. Bosses take 30% more of all of it.
#
# The beat is `subTime 990`, the same field Shurrikane and Bolt Barrage take
# theirs from and the only number in the block the readout never spends. Twelve
# firings fit the twelve seconds, and the twelfth is where the scroll bursts.
#
# The seven fixed stars are fired EVERY tick, not once at the start. Namu says
# so of the scroll -- of the stars it keeps firing, part of the count scales
# with the crowd -- `bulletCount` is GMS's per-cast line count everywhere else,
# and the band settles it: 276,720% at master is 4,612%/s against the wait,
# just under Storm of Arrows, where the once-at-the-start reading is 1,013%/s,
# far below the band.
#
# The 30% is the scroll's, stated once on the pulse and kept by the burst that
# goes out with it. On the buff it would be a character-wide boss bonus for
# twelve seconds of every sixty, which is a different and far stronger skill.
#
# The cast is the 120ms every buff raised from a sequence costs, not the 360ms
# of the scroll's own animation.
#
# Dropped: detonating it early, which needs a scroll to be somewhere, and the
# immunity to attack reflection, which nothing here has.
name: "Dark Lord's Omen"
description: "Unleash the power of the Dark Lord's insight."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 12.0
  pulse {
    label: "Throwing Stars"
    cast_interval_seconds: 0.99
    lines: 6
    max_enemies: 7
    max_pulses: 12
    base {
      skill_pct: 7.27
      boss_pct: 0.30
    }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.27 }
    fixed_strikes { hits: 7 }
    final_strike {
      label: "Explosion"
      lines: 12
      max_enemies: 12
      base { skill_pct: 16.32 }
      per_level { skill_pct: 0.62 }
    }
  }
}
